			title: "A Spark in the Ash"
			description: ["The fire is out. The world is quiet in the wrong way, like a bell that has just stopped ringing.", "In your hand: a sliver of crown-glass, warm as a living thing. The old tales called it an Ember. They said the Hollow Crown shattered and the pieces went looking for someone stubborn enough to carry them."]
